---
import AppLayout from '../../../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
import Topbar from '../../../components/Topbar.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
import AppRail from '../../../components/AppRail.astro';
import Chapter from '../../../components/Chapter.astro';
import ChapterShots from '../../../components/ChapterShots.astro';
import PrevNextApp from '../../../components/PrevNextApp.astro';
import { getApp } from '../../../data/apps';
const app = getApp('kvitteringsvakt');
---
<AppLayout app={app}>
  <Topbar variant="app" />
  <div class="app-page">
    <AppRail app={app} current="oversikt" />
    <div class="app-flow">
      <Chapter num="01" label="Why" title={`Norwegian <em>consumer law</em>, easy to use.`}>
        <p class="lede">Kvitteringsvakt exists because Norwegian consumer-purchase law gives you a five-year warranty period, and nobody remembers that when the washing machine breaks.</p>
        <p class="muted">Scan the receipt at the register, the app remembers the date, and notifies you before the warranty expires. Built for the Norwegian retail pattern.</p>
      </Chapter>
      <Chapter num="02" label="How it feels" title={`For when you <em>need the papers</em>.`}>
        <p>The white goods fail. Usually exactly at the moment you've forgotten where you put the receipt. Kvitteringsvakt is the one place you know you'll find it again — categorized, searchable, and with a PDF you can send the store.</p>
        <ChapterShots shots={[
          { src: '/screenshots/kvitteringsvakt/01-hjem.jpg', alt: 'Home screen' },
          { src: '/screenshots/kvitteringsvakt/02-skanning.jpg', alt: 'Receipt scanning' },
          { src: '/screenshots/kvitteringsvakt/03-reklamasjon.jpg', alt: 'Warranty claim' },
          { src: '/screenshots/kvitteringsvakt/04-forsikring.jpg', alt: 'Insurance' },
          { src: '/screenshots/kvitteringsvakt/05-statistikk.jpg', alt: 'Statistics' },
        ]} />
      </Chapter>
      <Chapter num="03" label="What it does" title={`<em>Scan, remember</em>, export.`}>
        <p>Scan a receipt in one second. Apple Vision reads store, amount, and date on the device. You can correct anything if OCR misses.</p>
        <p>Remembers the warranty period for you. Appliances, electronics, bikes. Each category has a typical expected lifetime that determines the warranty deadline.</p>
        <p>Search and export. Find by store, date, category. Export everything as a PDF for insurance claims or tax filing.</p>
      </Chapter>
      <PrevNextApp slug={app.slug} />
    </div>
  </div>
  <Footer label={`${app.name} · Haug & Datter`} />
</AppLayout>
